  "definition": "Calculation of Average Final Compensation - With Substantiated Grandfathered Amount",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-01-09",
  "historyNote": "#5595, eff 3-16-93 New. #7375, INTERIM, eff 10-13-00, EXPIRES: 4-11-01; ss by #7478, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7573, eff 10-10-01, EXPIRED: 10-10-09 New. #9562, eff 10-14-09, EXPIRED: 10-14-17 New. #12511, INTERIM, eff 4-11-18, EXPIRED: 10-8-18 New. #12707, eff 1-9-19",
